# The 'file' lexer mode swallows the rest of the word as a path.
animate exec %px = lane lanes 4 seed 1 nofile input 1 file img/no_such_file_998877.png
```spv
%l = OpLoad %uint %px
%b = OpShiftLeftLogical %uint %l %uint_30
```
